{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_15103240","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15103240","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:6:1510324001:0":{"text":"マーリン殿、何度言われても、俺の返事は変わらない。","source_cn":"梅林女士，无论再强调多少遍，我的回答都一样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCED1DBAF1E870CDD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1510324002:0":{"text":"ホーリン城が建つ遥か前から、俺たちは豊穣神を信仰している。ゼドラン様は、豊かな土地と麦畑を我らに授けてくださった。","source_cn":"早在呼临建城之前，我们就在信仰丰饶神赛图恩，他赐予我们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB38BE166BA53FE45","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1510324003:0":{"text":"よそ者の言葉だけで、その信仰が揺らぐことはあり得ない。","source_cn":"谁会因为外人的片面之词，就开始质疑信仰？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFEB383C131956B2F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1510324004:0":{"text":"分かっています。目の前の災害が、自分たちの信仰する神の仕業だと認めるのは、容易なことではないでしょう。","source_cn":"我知道，让人相信自己正在遭受的灾厄竟然来源于所信之神，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFFCF43E159336B9D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1510324005:0":{"text":"ですが、もし豊穣神がホーリンの領土と信徒たちにしたことを、あなたが実際に目にしたら……真実を目にした時、あなたはそれを認めますか？","source_cn":"但如果真见到丰饶神对呼临的领土和他的信众做了什么……你...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x57A620AFA069CCA8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1510324006:0":{"text":"ここでそんな言葉を聞かされること自体が、すでに信仰への冒涜だ。","source_cn":"光是在这里听你说出这些不敬的词句，已经是对信仰的亵渎。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E734D6046F9A02B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1510324007:0":{"text":"だが、約束通り、機会は与える。捕まった兵士たちを連れ戻してくれたからな。","source_cn":"但我愿意给你机会，女士。因为你依照约定，带回了我们被俘的人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x69DC94DB266BEFA5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1510324008:0":{"text":"私は人間と獣人の平和を望んでいるのです。","source_cn":"我在为两族的和平而努力。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0781B499A40520E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1510324009:0":{"text":"なぜそこまで獣人との和解にこだわる？あなたと彼らに、利害の一致などあるようには思えないが……","source_cn":"为什么一定要让我们和兽人握手言和呢？你和他们并无利益相关。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x82EEC4BC49E59699","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1510324010:0":{"text":"侵略と強奪では、あなた方の苦しみは終わらないからです！本来は豊かだったバルトシアの植物も、あなた方がやって来たことで枯れ始め、ついにはスピロクタスまで現れた。","source_cn":"因为扩张和掠夺无法解决你们的苦难！水泽营地附近原本茂盛...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79C7C7881EC5EBB9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_f